# Re-record the README demo with VHS: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
#
#   vhs demo/demo.tape
#
# The checked-in assets/demo.gif was rendered from a real `npm test` log on
# 2026-10-27 (34 checks, exit 0). Re-running this tape captures a fresh run on
# your machine; no output lines are written by hand.
Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "pwsh"
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 760
Set Height 420
Set Padding 16
Set MarginFill "#0A0E1A"
Set BorderRadius 16
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Sleep 800ms
Type "npm test"
Enter
Sleep 9s
